    summary: "Discipling aims at release. This lesson studies Luke 9:1-6, Luke 10:1-12, John 14:12-18, John 17:18-23 and Acts 1:6-11 to see Jesus sending the twelve and the seventy-two on short missions, promising that disciples would do greater works, giving the Spirit, praying for their unity and mission, and finally ascending after commissioning them, leaving the work in their hands.",
    scripture: ["Luke 10:1-12", "John 17:18-23"], more: ["Luke 9:1-6", "John 14:12-18", "Acts 1:6-11"], memory: "John 17:18",
